<title>USA: Kansas City Southern chairman dies.</title>
<headline>Kansas City Southern chairman dies.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kansas City Southern Industries Inc said chairman Paul Henson died Saturday in California after a long illness.</p>
<p>Chief executive and president Landon Rowland will continue to run the railroad and mutual funds company, it said.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
